error: `Int` is a type, so it takes no bound here
  --> examples/errors/extend_bound_on_type.lume:6:9
  |
6 | extend [Int: Ordered] with Named:
  |         ^
  help: `extend [Int] with ...` extends lists of `Int`; a bound belongs on a name the `extend` introduces, like `extend [T: Ordered] with ...`
